ore_item_assets/steam/apps/2201830/extras/629e0627bc24175f2a0c3ce957053177.poster.avif?t=1668788603\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201830/extras/629e0627bc24175f2a0c3ce957053177.webm?t=1668788603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201830/extras/629e0627bc24175f2a0c3ce957053177.mp4?t=1668788603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Infinite number of procedurally generated levels<br></li><li>Difficulty increases infinitely - your skill determines how far you can get<br></li><li> Online Leaderboard<br></li><li>50 minutes electronic music</li></ul>",
